Subject: [PATCH 4/6] Document proof stages in sequential repetition helpers

---
 TCSlib/Cryptography/Composability/SequentialZK.lean    | 10 ++++++++++
 .../Composability/SequentialZK/SimulatorMachine.lean   |  3 +++
 .../Composability/SequentialZK/StatisticalPrefix.lean  |  3 +++
